#. type: Content of: <messages><msg>
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:1 messages/po4a/en.xml:457
#, no-wrap
msgid "Dream"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title #
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Dream Mechanism"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> Nightly creative narratives generated after light sleep; not factual memory.\n"
"> Persisted as a **`content_block`** with semantic component **`dream`**, parented to the agent world's dated **`diary_entry`**.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <messages><msg>
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:10 docs/concepts/sleep.md:9
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:10 messages/po4a/en.xml:622
#: messages/po4a/en.xml:629
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:13
msgid ""
"Dreaming is the digital life's **imaginative** counterpart to memory "
"consolidation. It does not extract facts or update semantic inventory—it "
"produces a surreal, first-person narrative from the day's emotional tone and "
"random episodic fragments."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <messages><msg>
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:14 messages/po4a/en.xml:461
#, no-wrap
msgid "Trigger"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Condition                                                           | Result                     |\n"
"| ------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------- |\n"
"| No limbic brick with `intensity > 0.5` in the day's creation window | Skip (`no_strong_emotion`) |\n"
"| Dream block already exists for that day's diary                     | Skip (`already_dreamed`)   |\n"
"| At least one strong limbic anchor produced that day                 | Generate dream             |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:23
msgid ""
"Trigger is **purely emotion-driven** (no random dice). Session activity is "
"**not** required; episodic fragments may be empty."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Input"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:28
msgid ""
"**Emotional tone** — top 3 limbic `content_block`s whose `created_at` falls "
"in `[conversation day 00:00 CST, next day 06:00 CST)` where `intensity > "
"0.5`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:28
msgid ""
"**Episodic fragments** — random sample of user/assistant messages from the "
"day's sessions, capped ~4k chars."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:30
msgid "Light sleep stage 2 must complete first so limbic anchors exist."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <messages><msg>
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:31 messages/po4a/en.xml:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "Output"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:37
msgid ""
"Ensure agent default private world diary for CST `dream_day` (create empty "
"shell if missing)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:37
msgid ""
"Insert `content_block` (`block_type: text`) with components `content_block` "
"+ `dream`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:37
msgid "Append-only; content is not updated after creation."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:37
msgid "Does **not** create notification inbox entries."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:39
msgid ""
"Legacy `dream_memory` / `dream_entry` rows are backfilled and removed in "
"Drizzle migration `20260717180000_memory_bricks_to_diary`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:40 docs/concepts/sleep.md:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Orchestration"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:43
msgid "Sleep-cycle DAG node `dream` (unchanged topology):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:44
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"light-sleep\n"
"  ├─► deep-sleep ──► memory-ref-sync\n"
"  ├─► dream        (parallel)\n"
"  └─► self-layer-refresh\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tools & UI"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:57
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Surface                                                | Purpose                                     |\n"
"| ------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `diary_get` / `content_block_list` (`component=dream`) | Read dream narrative                        |\n"
"| Shell `/diary`                                         | Browse dream blocks labeled「梦境」（只读） |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:59
msgid "No independent `/dream` Shell module or `dream` ToolSet."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "Design Notes"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:64
msgid "Dreams are **not** injected into system prompt or resident memory."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:64
msgid "Accuracy is explicitly **not** a goal; association and metaphor are."
msgstr ""

